/- GID: D5/S3/FiniteGroups/GroupAlgebra/CyclicNormOne
   generality: G
   mirror-B: D5/B/S3/FiniteGroups/GroupAlgebra/CyclicNormOne
   mirror-E: none(waiver:evidence-not-specified-by-formal-manifest)
   anchors: [mathlib/module/Mathlib.Algebra.Ring.Aut, mathlib/module/Mathlib.Algebra.BigOperators.Intervals, mathlib/module/Mathlib.Algebra.BigOperators.Ring.Finset]
